WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:09.250
Go to the sign in page, "/admin/login".

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.880
Type your email in the Email box.

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:28.239
Type "not-the-password"
in the Password box.

00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:39.072
Click Sign in.

00:00:40.672 --> 00:00:46.672
Check the Sign in heading and
the message above the boxes.

00:00:53.383 --> 00:00:59.383
Type your password in the Password box.

00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:09.545
Click Sign in again.

00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:17.161
Check the Enter your code page.
